{"set_num":65,"set_name":"2025年浙江事业单位下","questions":[{"q_num":1,"type":"资料分析","answer":"C","analysis_html":"<p>下半年-上半年=（全年-上半年）-上半年=全年-上半年×2=20.11-10.32×2=20.11-20.64=-0.53，所以选择<strong>C选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":2,"type":"资料分析","answer":"A","analysis_html":"<p>只给了全年和上半年的数据，下半年=全年-上半年，基期差问题。全年国内销量10.05万台，同比增长11.7%，上半年国内销量5.34万台，同比增长4.7%，思路一：增速适合估算增量，基期差=现期差-Δ全+Δ上≈10.05-5.34-10.05÷10（份数法）+5.34×4.7%（化除为乘）≈4.71-1+5×5%（乘法放缩）=3.96，所以选择A选项。思路二：增速靠近适合拉平，5.34×（1+7%）≈5.7，10.05-5.7=4.35，4.35÷1.117≈4.35-0.45=3.9，所以选择<strong>A选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":3,"type":"资料分析","answer":"B","analysis_html":"<p>要找同比增加2000以上的，可以对比<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">现期</span></span>与增速的大小，首先排除增速为负的机型，6~10吨：<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">55717</span></span>≈4%＜16%，10~18.5吨：<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">24643</span></span>≈8%＞1.53%，18.5~28.5吨：<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">50930</span></span>≈4%＜5.27%，<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">18728</span></span>≈10%＞5.89%，有2种，所以选择<strong>B选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":4,"type":"资料分析","answer":"B","analysis_html":"<p>使用线段法，先用拉平思维计算基期比≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">18728</span><span class=\"frac-den\">11060×（1+25%）</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">18700</span><span class=\"frac-den\">11000×（1+25%）</span></span>≈（18700-18700×10%）×0.8≈1.34约等于4:3，增速差为5.89-（-15.5）=21.39≈21，大型挖掘机累计同比增速=-15.5%+21%×<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">4</span><span class=\"frac-den\">7</span></span>=-3.5%，所以选择<strong>B选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":5,"type":"资料分析","answer":"D","analysis_html":"<p>小型挖掘机≈40000+55000+25000-75000=45000，中型挖掘机≈50000-14000=36000，大型挖掘机≈18000+11000-11000=18000，小型挖掘机最大，排除AB选项，中型挖掘机约是大型的两倍，排除BC选项，所以选择<strong>D选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":6,"type":"资料分析","answer":"B","analysis_html":"<p>非村办卫生室数量=2711+129+1553+1187，使用尾数法，1+9+3+7=20，所以选择<strong>B选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":7,"type":"资料分析","answer":"B","analysis_html":"<p>中西医占所有卫生室占比=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2298</span><span class=\"frac-den\">194+9089+2298</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2300</span><span class=\"frac-den\">200+9100+2300</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2300</span><span class=\"frac-den\">200+9100+2300</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2300</span><span class=\"frac-den\">11600</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">2300</span><span class=\"frac-den\">11100</span></span>≈23%-23%×10%=20.7%，所以选择<strong>B选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":8,"type":"资料分析","answer":"A","analysis_html":"<p>先计算人数：村办≈5200+2350+3500+200=11250，乡卫生院设点≈530+140+700+200=1570，联合办≈140+20+60+0=220，私人办≈1100+500+900+0=2500，接着观察医疗收入比上人数，只有村办<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">126988.6</span><span class=\"frac-den\">11250</span></span>＞10，其他三村都小于10，所以村办的人均医疗收入最高，所以选择<strong>A选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":9,"type":"资料分析","answer":"C","analysis_html":"<p>药品废支出占总支出比例：村办≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">86000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">86000+39000</span></span>=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">86000</span><span class=\"frac-den\">125000</span></span>=86%×0.8=68.8%，私人办≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">9100</span><span class=\"frac-den\">9100+6900</span></span>=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">9100</span><span class=\"frac-den\">16000</span></span>=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">4550</span><span class=\"frac-den\">8000</span></span>≈57%，68.8%-57%=11.8%，所以选择<strong>C选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":10,"type":"资料分析","answer":"D","analysis_html":"<p>A选项：西医注册护士人数为2129，乡村医生人数为4951，不能得出；<br>B选项：联合办村卫生室人员经费支出为516.3＜药品费1059.4，所以占比＜50%，不能得出；<br>C选项：每个卫生室药品收入：中医=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">1634.4</span><span class=\"frac-den\">194</span></span>＜10，中西医结合=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">22694.2</span><span class=\"frac-den\">2298</span></span>≈10，中医＜中西医结合，不能得出；<br>D选项：<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">药品收入</span><span class=\"frac-den\">上级补助收入</span></span>=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">7302.3</span><span class=\"frac-den\">986.3</span></span>＞7，可以得出；所以选择<strong>D选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":11,"type":"资料分析","answer":"C","analysis_html":"<p>使用拉平思维，<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">实用新型专利授权数</span><span class=\"frac-den\">发明专利授权数</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">209×（1+53%）</span><span class=\"frac-den\">92</span></span>≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">210</span><span class=\"frac-den\">91</span></span>×1.5≈（2.1+2.1×10%）×1.5≈2.3×1.5≈3.5，所以选择<strong>C选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":12,"type":"资料分析","answer":"B","analysis_html":"<p>方法一：使用份数法修正，增速18.5%接近16.7%比16.7%约大了10%，增量≈500÷7×（1+10%）≈71×1.1≈78；方法二：代入法，观察到选项较为接近，取中间值80代入，增量≈（500-80）×18.5%≈420×18.5%≈（420-20）×（18.5%+1%）≈400×19.5%=78；所以选择<strong>B选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":13,"type":"资料分析","answer":"D","analysis_html":"<p>使用化除为乘，非国内申请人提交增量=总增量-国内申请人提交增量≈7.38×（-0.9%）-6.88×（-0.5%）≈-（0.0738-0.0738×10%）+0.0344≈-0.0664+0.0344=-0.032万件=-320件，所以选择<strong>D选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":14,"type":"资料分析","answer":"A","analysis_html":"<p>复审请求结案率：实用新型专利=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">0.63</span><span class=\"frac-den\">0.63</span></span>，发明专利=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">5.88</span><span class=\"frac-den\">9.91</span></span>，外观设计专利=<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">0.03</span><span class=\"frac-den\">0.08</span></span>，实用新型专利=100%最大，排除BC选项，发明专利＞50%＞外观设计专利，所以选择<strong>A选项</strong>。</p>"},{"q_num":15,"type":"资料分析","answer":"C","analysis_html":"<p>观察饼状图，只有B选项白色超过50%，带入验证新型专利权增速23.4%与总增速接近23.2%，现期不到总量的50%，排除；AD选项灰色与白色面积接近，使用拉平思维，“实用”比上“外观”≈<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac-num\">3894×（1+4%）</span><span class=\"frac-den\">3207</span></span>＞1.2，排除AD选项，所以选择<strong>C选项</strong>。</p>"}]}